<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, MAY 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	May 07	May 06   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  273.330     274.590     247.020   10.65 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.660     309.750     306.830    0.92 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.780     158.830     158.970   -0.12 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.042	47.074	47.182   -0.30 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  447.440     447.340     419.180    6.74 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.155     141.205     141.685   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.045	16.052	16.185   -0.86 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.450     218.250     212.430    2.83 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.880	 1.882	 1.888   -0.42 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.579	 1.580	 1.581   -0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  187.235     186.590     183.135    2.24 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
